.\" The manual page of the web page's launcher, which dog-vision-web installs.
.TH DOG-VISION-WEB 1 "" "dog-vision" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dog-vision-web \- how a dog or another animal sees colours, in the browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dog-vision-web
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dog-vision-web
opens dog-vision's web page, \fI/usr/share/dog-vision-web/index.html\fR, in the system's browser through
.BR xdg-open (1).
The page shows a photo, a video or the camera
with the colours a dog, a cat or another animal can tell apart, beside the original.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dog-vision-cli (1),
.BR xdg-open (1)
.PP
https://github.com/loplex/dog-vision
